<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rates rise one bp for all maturities.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rates rise one bp for all maturities.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) rose 0.01 percentage point for each of the one-month, three-month and six-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its  BUBOR Reuters page on Friday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.28 percent, the three-month rate at 21.15 percent and the six-month rate at 21.01 percent, all unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
